# DPPO HalfCheetah reproduction

Status: executed smoke results; approved full runs in progress.

## Question
Does the unmodified DPPO implementation and released HalfCheetah checkpoint reproduce the approximate Fig. 5 fine-tuning curve under the user's three-seed protocol?

## Answer so far
The smoke test's pretrained evaluation was 4,272.95, inside the required 3,850–4,650 range; its two saved iterations and checkpoints passed verification. Full-curve reproduction remains unassessed while the three-seed batch runs. [Smoke record](runs/smoke/manifest.json).

